steps:
Create backend/package.json as the pnpm workspace root:
{
  "name": "clinvo-backend",
  "private": true,
  "scripts": {
    "build": "pnpm -r build",
    "dev": "pnpm -r --parallel dev"
  }
}

Implement backend/packages/shared/src/types.ts with TypeScript interfaces matching every DB table:
  - Tenant { id, name, ownerName, ownerEmail, ownerPhone, createdAt }
  - Plan { id, name, description, priceInr, isActive }
  - PlanFeature { planId, featureKey, value }
  - License { id, tenantId, planId, apiKeyHash, apiKeyPrefix, status, expiresAt, createdAt, lastSeenAt, notes }
  - LicenseFeatureOverride { licenseId, featureKey, value }
  - LicenseEvent { id, licenseId, eventType, metadata, createdAt }
  - LicenseStatus = 'active' | 'paused' | 'expired' | 'cancelled'
  - VerifyKeyResponse (the feature flag payload from roadmap section: valid, status, plan, tenantId, expiresAt, features)
  - PaginatedResponse<T> { data: T[], total: number, page: number, pageSize: number }

Implement backend/packages/shared/src/db.ts:
  import postgres from 'postgres';
  import { drizzle } from 'drizzle-orm/postgres-js';
  import * as schema from './schema.js';
  export function createDb(connectionString: string) {
    const client = postgres(connectionString);
    return drizzle(client, { schema });
  }
  export type Db = ReturnType<typeof createDb>;

Implement backend/packages/shared/src/utils/crypto.ts:
  import { createHash, randomBytes } from 'node:crypto';
  export function hashApiKey(key: string): string {
    return createHash('sha256').update(key).digest('hex');
  }
  export function generateApiKey(env: 'live' | 'test'): string {
    const hex = randomBytes(16).toString('hex'); // 32 hex chars
    return `clnv_${env}_${hex}`;
  }

Implement backend/packages/shared/src/utils/pagination.ts:
  export interface PaginationQuery { page: number; pageSize: number; }
  export function parsePaginationQuery(query: Record<string, unknown>): PaginationQuery {
    const page = Math.max(1, parseInt(String(query.page ?? 1), 10));
    const pageSize = Math.min(100, Math.max(1, parseInt(String(query.pageSize ?? 20), 10)));
    return { page, pageSize };
  }

Create backend/packages/shared/drizzle.config.ts for drizzle-kit (used for local migration generation only — not run in CI):
  export default {
    schema: './src/schema.ts',
    out: './migrations',
    dialect: 'postgresql',
    dbCredentials: { url: process.env.DATABASE_URL! }
  };
